{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jWK0QpcPtMR7xmnB8NxNAQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:08.587047+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jWK0QpcPtMR7xmnB8NxNAQ","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRI6KV8kacmt8BibelKJmABibKG4V2mFKMSecLssm7Zgnm2QMDsDqkhXMPg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>01</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>项目简介</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>面对未来科技与工程发展，适应产业升级转型战略需求，作为融合</span><span>工程技术、数据科学、管理理论的交叉学科，</span><span>工程管理硕士（<span>Master of Engineering Management</span>，简称MEM）</span><span>旨在培养在各类大型工程的设计、制造、建造、运维过程中进行项目系统集成分析、工程软件开发、系统工程管理，具备大工程观、系统思维以及数据驱动复杂工程管控能力的工程实践与创新人才。</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>华中科技大学土木与水利工程学院是全国首批工程管理硕士（MEM）培养单位之一，</span><span>依托学校深厚的工科底蕴、学院强大的科研平台，丰富的产业平台和校企合作资源，深度融合企业发展与精准人才需求，为学科进步、企业创新提供新的驱动力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>02</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>院系介绍</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRIh67H8AfEaoI6K27GehFDaSFnUuXicg40sD1KuJXHtqNFliakr1VlGNRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>师资教学一流</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>现有中国工程院院士2人，外籍院士1人，教授51名，副教授53名，形成了由“院士—领军人才—青年人才”构成的完整人才链，有效保障了教学质量。同时，以AACSB、IPMP国际认证和教育部“专业学位授权点自我评估指标体系”为标准，构建教学质量保障体系。近年获2项国家级教学成果奖。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRI2gJqrKJGsp1IqiadkNAk48gEy5q8BAGnVeuhv3dLsFWNsOH0Pc08PSw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>丁烈云院士领衔撰写的《数字建造》丛书</span></span></p><p><span><span>喜获第五届中国出版政府奖图书奖</span></span></p><p><span><span>丁烈云院士团队入选教育部战略性新兴领域</span></span></p><p><span><span>“十四五\"高等教育教材体系建设团队</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>拥有“土木工程”和“水利工程”两个一级学科博士和硕士学位授予权以及土木水利、交通运输2个专业学位博士点，以及工程管理专业学位硕士点。水利工程是国家“211工程”和“985工程”重点建设学科，土木工程为湖北省一级学科重点学科，桥梁与隧道工程为住建部重点学科。</span></p><p><span>※“土木工程”下设</span><span>智能建造、</span><span>结构工程、岩土工程、防灾减灾工程与防护工程、桥梁与隧道工程、道路与交通工程等二级学科方向。</span></p><p><span>※“水利工程”下设水利水电工程和水文学及水资源两个二级学科方向。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>科研实力雄厚</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>拥有国家数字建造技术创新中心、</span><span>教育部智能建造国际合作联合实验室、</span><span>控制结构湖北省重点实验室、</span><span>数字流域科学与技术湖北省重点实验室、</span><span>数字建造与工程安全湖北省工程研究中心、土木工程质量检测中心、中欧水电能源技术中心、中美国际水安全联合研究中心、住建部批准的全国监理工程师培训中心等教学科研平台，大力支撑学院学科专业发展。</span></p><p><span><span>其中，国家数字建造技术创新中心是目前人工智能和数字经济背景下工程建造领域国家级平台。</span>面向智能建造强国目标，聚焦数字化设计与CIM、智能感知与工程物联网、智能工程机械与建造机器人、工程大数据平台与智能服务等关键共性技术开展攻关，重点突破数字建造软件、网络、硬件和平台的技术瓶颈，建成持续开放的研发创新平台及产业创新园区。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kmcdRUkSibWNzNLuzwXXSaGSdVL7pYjXaia06W27kcqSm7v8hJS96PQpEkuf6j7A8Lpww3BwKiad4iaZTY3ymmQztg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>培养特色鲜明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>严格遵循国家办学政策,积极围绕国家和产业的重大需求联合企业进行有组织的招生培养,全面落实立德树人根本任务,创新构建了“国际国内相结合、校内校外相结合、产学研相结合”的“三结合”育人机制,按照“有组织、定期反馈、协作交流”的原则，通过导师团队定向指导、定制课程、现场调研等举措创新性地打造满足企业关键技术人才需求的校企联合培养模式。</span></p><p><span>实施\"教学-实践-竞赛\"三位一体的创新型人才培养模式，与行业龙头企业共建多个产学研协同育人基地，为学生创新实践能力的培养提供了坚实的平台支撑；组织MEM专业在校生参加国内外各级赛事，2022年至2024年累计获奖25人次。</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRIgXiaZZ2OwYnNsfjbErDQOBRtwurcib8Wca14t6Ba1IU7emCRSp8U8F8w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRIibsWIPYic4a3KUApn0dXrkiceWSP1vYBD7MogVYGSmxURY3Z20lUttO3g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRIpsicrgrKsCeE5PWqJZ4t8Axn2sPmuJhI2VShgEWjyGIpYoOJbiacZpzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>发展前景广阔</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>专业涵盖方向齐全，与智能科技、信息科技、数字科技、生命科学深度交叉融合，聚焦国家重大需求。</span></p><p><span>学位点累计培养MEM学生600多人,为中建三局、上海隧道、中冶集团、中铁大桥局、东风汽车等大中型知名企业培养出一批杰出的行业骨干和行业精英，在推动企业转型升级和行业高质量发展中发挥了重要作用。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRInA6SdCzkZRWibemBiceNb1ibyT7KGQsoDjnLfdXqsIkPQ3EI7XpKl9OiaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRI8Hd1rPcghpNA1E9NgibYrlb8DZnakYduDiaZSAeUOEib5JJ5LqUaZonZA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><strong><span>MEM学生</span></strong><strong><span>可申请获得</span></strong></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>华中科技大学土木与水利工程学院MEM学生可获国际项目经理资质认证（IPMP）相应课程免试。学院每年定期组织MEM学生参加IPMP认证并获取证书。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kmcdRUkSibWNzNLuzwXXSaGSdVL7pYjXagfncJM653mlSguBV1X0Bia6bTgmcqfzoO8T9HhcSR85v6BNeXJgU81A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>MEM暑期研学营</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>为进一步响应国家培养高层次、应用型工程管理人才的号召，土木与水利工程学院MEM暑期研学营聚焦智能建造、数字孪生、数字化创新等领域的学科优势，依托华中科技大学国家数字建造技术创新中心的顶尖科研平台，为广大优秀学子提供学术深造与工程实践融合的高端学习体验。</span></p><p><span>本次研学营将通过行业前沿讲座、工程实践考察等丰富活动，助力学员深入探索现代工程管理的创新模式与发展趋势。我们期待与每一位怀揣梦想的青年共同成长，在华科MEM的平台上锤炼工程实践能力、数字化管理思维和全球行业视野，成长为推动产业转型升级、服务国家战略需求的复合型工程管理人才。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>工程前沿，智造未来！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>欢迎广大有志青年踊跃申请！</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kmcdRUkSibWNzNLuzwXXSaGSdVL7pYjXaZKn49SrYxvAXjicEUvMTCIy0JCvsJckhgvI6icEicboDayKiccjPJ5noBg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>一、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>3.身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>4.学历符合下列条件之一：</span></p><p><span>①大学本科毕业后有3年或3年以上工作经验的人员（2023年9月1日前获得本科毕业证书）；</span></p><p><span>②获得国家承认的高职高专毕业学历或大学本科结业后，有5年或5年以上工作经验，达到与大学本科毕业生同等学力的人员（2021年9月1日前获得专科毕业证书或本科结业证书）；</span></p><p><span>③已获硕士学位或博士学位后有 2 年或2 年以上工作经验的人员（2024年9月1日前获得研究生学位证书）。</span></p><p><span>在境外获得学历学位证书的申请人在报名时须提交教育部留学服务中心提供的学历学位认证书编号及复印件。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请材料</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.身份证复印件</span></p><p><span>2.学历、学位证书复印件及《教育部学历证书电子注册备案表》。</span></p><p><span>注：《教育部学历证书电子注册备案表》请登录教育部学信中心官网查询下载，网址：http://www.chsi.cn/。</span></p><p><span>3.《MEM暑期研学营申请表》</span></p><p><span><span>（加入官方QQ群780907112下载群文件</span>，申请人须确保申请材料真实无误，若后期经核查申请材料不属实，将取消申请资格。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>三、申请流程</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>第一步：申请意向登记。</span></p><p><span>扫描下方二维码，登记入营意向，中心对申请人的个人信息严格保密。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kmcdRUkSibWNzNLuzwXXSaGSdVL7pYjXaEdKEKibfibicVKnSJA8B5DcaHvPXShiaH0ia1s6UIKgIujH6aQAMOudGamw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>第二步：电子版申请材料提交。</span></p><p><span><span>请将申请材料1-3按序合并为一个PDF，发送邮件至tumuzt</span></span><span><span><span>@hust.edu.cn，</span>PDF文件名和邮件名统一命名为“姓名-华科土木学院MEM暑期研学营”。</span></span></p><p><span>第三步：材料审核。</span></p><p><span>MEM教育中心将集中审核申请材料，通过审核者，可获得2025年土木与水利工程学院MEM暑期研学营入营资格。中心将分批组织营员参加MEM暑期研学营活动。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>华中科技大学土木与水利工程学院MEM暑期研学营包含专业介绍、实验室参观、前沿讲座、名企参访、校园初体验等内容。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、活动时间与安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>MEM暑期研学营时间与安排将根据申请情况确定，以官网及申请系统通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、活动收获</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>MEM暑期研学营结束后，营员将获得华中科技大学土木与水利工程学院颁发的“华中科技大学土木与水利工程学院MEM暑期研学营营员”荣誉证书。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、信息查询与咨询</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请过程中如有任何问题，您可通过以下方式与我们取得联系，或查询网址获取更多信息：</span></p><p><span>地址：武汉市洪山区珞喻路1037号华中科技大学土木与水利工程学院414室</span></p><p><span>学院官网：http://civil.hust.edu.cn    </span></p><p><span>国家数字建造技术创新中心官网：https://ndc.hust.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>咨询电话：027-87557124（王老师），15902767106（朱老师） </span></p><p><span>官方微信：华中科技大学MEM教育中心</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section><p><span>（点击上方链接可直接关注官方微信公众号）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>  官方QQ群：</span><span>780907112</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kmcdRUkSibWPfxRvw8Crhru6ibQoW8pQRIPiaLI6uucQp4nD9dp1dicxHrwM9VzcPCuPn13LicAG3gY2yd1E4wls1mw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d6d68b4ec078a4c12b19769eab509f76e09a4ced8029fbb58d37e11421158dd5","textLength":2984,"sourceSha256":"8c2e08baca5027b91613102c265d5ea13a3f9b6